WEBVTT

00:25:58.079 --> 00:26:02.413
the idea of a character who is
desperate to find immortality

00:26:02.746 --> 00:26:08.288
and it felt like it was sitting
there and that it was

00:26:08.288 --> 00:26:14.496
a set up potential set up. And I kept
imagining it as something that could work.

00:26:14.788 --> 00:26:19.496
You know, if I'm a kid watching all
nine movies years from now,

00:26:19.746 --> 00:26:26.621
it felt like something that was a possible
setup to be examined later.

00:26:26.871 --> 00:26:31.538
I will say that it's something that
I loved the possibility of it and